silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_02_sources_and_closure_sections_01_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'CannonOrGptAbsorptionYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Cannon-or-Generated-Witness Absorption', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Cannon-or-Generated-Witness Absorption', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .
